                               "The promised date for %s in the agent's most recent read-back, written as YYYY-MM-DD. The read-back says the weekday, "
                               "day, month and year. Leave empty if that read-back has no promise for it." % which,
                               pattern="^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$", conf=0.4))
